{"type":"text","timestamp":1794347414866,"sessionID":"ses_e38a17480ffeF6R9mwCmekyvhF","part":{"id":"prt_1c770b53c00105vujDuWvO4P1d","messageID":"msg_1c7704616001kCvYLJ4x7g3jr6","sessionID":"ses_e38a17480ffeF6R9mwCmekyvhF","type":"text","text":"Implemented the bank app end to end.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`)\n- SQLite (`./data/bank.db`) with users, sessions, transfers; balances stored as integer cents.\n- Auth: register (201), login (200 `{\"token\"}`), logout, bearer-token auth on protected routes, `GET /api/auth/csrf`.\n- `GET /api/account`, `POST /api/transfers` (atomic `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` debit/credit + insert), `GET /api/transfers` (paged, newest first, scoped to the user), `GET /api/transfers/{id}`.\n- Validation/messages for missing recipient, self-transfer, invalid amount, insufficient balance; unknown `/api/*` returns JSON 404 while other paths fall back to the SPA.\n- `requirements.lock` simplified to a working constraints file (the old hash-pinned one failed pip's hash mode).\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`)\n- React + TypeScript + Tailwind (only `src/index.css` for Tailwind directives).\n- Auth screen with register/login, signed-in username, prominent balance card, transfer form with review/confirm step surfacing API errors (e.g. insufficient balance), and paged history with direction, counterparty, amount, memo, and date.\n- Added `tsconfig.json`, Tailwind/PostCSS config, `typecheck` script; `npm ci && npm run build` verified.\n\nVerified API behavior, concurrency (20 parallel transfers), restart persistence, SPA serving, and production build.","time":{"start":1794347414844,"end":1794347414847}}}
